        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-30T20:03:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is a target its own ally?</p><p>That is, Living Force Field Generators provide +2 defense to \"allies within two hexes.\" Does the force field generator benefit from its own effect?&nbsp;</p><p>Pretty sure the answer is yes, but we've been playing a lot of 4th edition D&amp;D recently where \"your allies\" excludes you.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:26.129Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
