        "raw": "<p>Is a target its own ally?</p><p>That is, Living Force Field Generators provide +2 defense to &quot;allies within two hexes.&quot; Does the force field generator benefit from its own effect?&nbsp;</p><p>Pretty sure the answer is yes, but we&#39;ve been playing a lot of 4th edition D&amp;D recently where &quot;your allies&quot; excludes you.&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
